Plugin-Version: 1.0.0
Plugin-Class: org.gameyfin.plugins.store.epic.EpicPlugin
Plugin-Id: org.gameyfin.plugins.store.epic
Plugin-Name: Epic Games Store (egdata.app)
Plugin-Description: Tracks versions, DLC and editions of games on the Epic Games Store via egdata.app.<br>
 Epic only exposes build data to its own launcher, so this plugin uses the community catalog egdata.app.
Plugin-Short-Description: Versions and DLC from the Epic Games Store
Plugin-Author: grimsi
Plugin-License: MIT
Plugin-Url: https://github.com/gameyfin
